# Components

## Folder-per-component

- Every component lives in `<name>/index.tsx`.
- Private children → `<name>/_components/<child>.tsx` (or nested folders).
- Named export `function ComponentName()` — no default export for components.

## Placement

| Scope | Path |
|-------|------|
| One route only | `src/app/<route>/_components/<name>/` |
| Layout / homepage only | `src/app/_components/<name>/` |
| Shared across 2+ routes | `src/components/<name>/` |
| Shared forms | `src/components/forms/<name>/` |
| shadcn primitives | `src/components/ui/*` (flat) |

Never park single-route UI in `src/components/`.
